### ユーザー登録
POST {{localBaseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "name": "テストユーザー{{$randomInt 100 999}}",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ユーザー登録 (Lightsail)
POST {{lightsailBaseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test03@example.com",
  "name": "テストユーザー03",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ユーザー登録 (EC2)
POST {{ec2BaseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test03@example.com",
  "name": "テストユーザー03",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ユーザー登録 (ECS)
POST {{ecsBaseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test03@example.com",
  "name": "テストユーザー03",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ユーザー完全更新 (PUT)
PUT {{localBaseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated01@example.com",
  "name": "更新済みユーザー01",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### ユーザー完全更新 (PUT) (Lightsail)
PUT {{lightsailBaseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

