GET http://localhost:3333/api/health

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users/1

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3333/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "New User"
}

### Update a user
PUT http://localhost:3333/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated User Name"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/users/3 